  "description": "Seo-Ha has spent two years working as a secretary for the cold Do-Hyeon, the director of a conglomerate, while harboring a secret, unrequited love for him. But when a canceled flight strands them together for one unexpected night, everything changes. What begins as a secret fling quickly spirals into something far more complicated when Do-Hyeon’s powerful family starts arranging his marriage to another woman, and Seo-Ha discovers that she is pregnant. Will Seo-Ha be able to win Do-Hyeon’s heart, or will she lose him to another woman forever?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
